{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under "},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/adyenactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct\/twint-swift.struct\/maxissuernumber"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For this to work, "},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must include “twint-extended”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you configure any "},{"code":"maxIssuerNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above "},{"code":"maxIssuerNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text